@StorageApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5051

### Hämta alla produkter
GET {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Hämta en produkt
GET {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Sök på kategori
GET {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?category=Verktyg
Accept: application/json

### Sök på kategori och namn
GET {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?category=Verktyg&name=ham
Accept: application/json

### Statistik
GET {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/stats
Accept: application/json

### Skapa produkt
POST {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Skruvmejsel",
  "price": 89,
  "category": "Verktyg",
  "shelf": "A3",
  "count": 25,
  "description": "Stjärnskruvmejsel PH2"
}

### Skapa produkt med ogiltig data (ska ge 400)
POST {{StorageApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "category": "Verktyg",
  "shelf": "A3",
  "count": 1
}
